# Lesson 4: Connections
# A child starts noticing things go together.
# Not abstract categories — concrete observations.
# "Cat has legs. Dog has legs. I have legs."
# Categories EMERGE from these connections.

# --- Things that are alike ---
cat has fur
dog has fur
cat has eyes
dog has eyes
mom has eyes
dad has eyes

# --- Things do things ---
cat can run
dog can run
cat can eat
dog can eat
cat can see
dog can see

# --- Things go together ---
mom has name
dad has name
cat has name
dog has name

# --- Simple cause and effect ---
hot causes pain
cold causes shiver
hungry causes eat
tired causes sleep
happy causes smile
sad causes cry

# --- Places ---
cat lives home
dog lives home
mom lives home
dad lives home
